    {
      "id": "a17cd5ff-9d58-43ca-aa29-d5242f8059fd",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute o áudio e acompanhe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "29edf19a-d944-4c69-bf9c-ed2d22d2c2d2",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe a cena e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>En esta calle hay una farmacia.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Nesta rua há uma farmácia.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ce9b0d3572424d6392c324d3da4e8439_b01-calle-con-farmacia-y-banco.png?Expires=1794099487&Signature=Gg-vNK~Q~Z14hgD2o4kWbNL8sj1Zg4VUa90w5RHKwkfwNGIXt40WNDNlaCYguqt-Tsj2V0B2tfNd-XG4KoLUxVld91Jn52b4feGotjC6VqzIuLY9sFojR2f6z~E5HqDQa4xxe9TSPhSPsJ3BDM3n1BAHA~zWqXPeqf5JmTq68N~0lS5jWfvSKLYmlHjo~9dL96qG2rxxvuhaaW-kDyWBISliKmbB662gjatk8iITgPoHtVSUAhbSL3GJMLh26CvS5Y6-B26gRiN512z9C5MrSotyMcJgf-sfiR0MGdYuTixOXYKLXwP7LxiTIsJn92k0QNsQl5am-2kbofLkQKzVnQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
