    {
      "id": "382fa140-e28f-4f0b-b6a9-f2e1cdc5c86f",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e ligue \"hay\" ao que existe na cena.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e6a6c10e-fee5-4646-a9c2-dca964214f3b",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>hay</strong> ajuda a dizer que um lugar existe em uma rua, bairro ou área.</p><p>Em <strong>En esta calle hay una farmacia</strong>, o foco não é o ponto exato, e sim o fato de que a farmácia existe ali.</p><p>Use essa forma quando a informação principal for \"tem\".</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4f3a3b88-75d6-4d3d-b4ac-0ffeeac69bd4",
      "title": "Observe a mesma rua, escute o áudio e acompanhe a nova frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "942d15ed-0fc1-45f4-8852-a0d232932b14",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a informação muda.</p><p><strong>La farmacia está al lado del banco.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>A farmácia fica ao lado do banco.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ce9b0d3572424d6392c324d3da4e8439_b01-calle-con-farmacia-y-banco.png?Expires=1794099487&Signature=Gg-vNK~Q~Z14hgD2o4kWbNL8sj1Zg4VUa90w5RHKwkfwNGIXt40WNDNlaCYguqt-Tsj2V0B2tfNd-XG4KoLUxVld91Jn52b4feGotjC6VqzIuLY9sFojR2f6z~E5HqDQa4xxe9TSPhSPsJ3BDM3n1BAHA~zWqXPeqf5JmTq68N~0lS5jWfvSKLYmlHjo~9dL96qG2rxxvuhaaW-kDyWBISliKmbB662gjatk8iITgPoHtVSUAhbSL3GJMLh26CvS5Y6-B26gRiN512z9C5MrSotyMcJgf-sfiR0MGdYuTixOXYKLXwP7LxiTIsJn92k0QNsQl5am-2kbofLkQKzVnQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7e1fea5f3ede4b88a25e011a7f0301d7_b03-la-farmacia-esta-al-lado-del-banco.mp3?Expires=1794099487&Signature=sBxRe2b1gcOSQ-k~N-kNeWgki7Q528DpqYNh~TBVGe-i68WbT6pfG6M0AkBxnAUnfD-OaqQJy2x8rltk-EMCCGbQnio8xGQuzMwQUUfioRItTnbpwcnAjlkA93RhNkuOmuLDGaSyirF82XCb~~72UWpEM0OQcNN6Y7vWvQla~PNw9YE9oCYSCYO5z4ACcS1jt5Orlqr1IdurGI88zx7zJlTl6SRLdNu2sdIIoxbYj-tUgX2JKeplhSPeI-3srxNFJFgHVuiaSzQMt1qDuteca3B8bmDcAZClGAMkf5c0A0hiMXYVE6iqHt5GIPPOZ6-Ytd1kUjRbsQ-D6zJuOV8uEg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
